### ============================================================
### Student Services - Grupo B  -  pruebas REST (IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client)
### ============================================================

@host = http://localhost:8081
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Registro de estudiante
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "ana.lopez@uees.edu.sv",
  "fullName": "Ana Lopez",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "profilePictureUrl": "https://i.pravatar.cc/200?u=ana"
}

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "ana.lopez@uees.edu.sv",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

> {%
client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken);
client.global.set("refresh", response.body.refreshToken);
client.global.set("studentId", response.body.studentId);
%}

### 3. Refresh
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}"
}

### 4. Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Mis certificados
GET {{host}}/api/certificates/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Listado certificados de un estudiante
GET {{host}}/api/certificates/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Progreso en un curso
GET {{host}}/api/progress/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Ranking del curso (Pageable)
GET {{host}}/api/progress/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/ranking?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Publicar mensaje en el foro
POST {{host}}/api/courses/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/forum
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "content": "Hola comunidad, este es mi primer mensaje en el foro!"
}

### 10. Historial del foro paginado
GET {{host}}/api/courses/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/forum?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Sincronizacion CRM
POST {{host}}/api/crm/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Swagger
GET {{host}}/swagger-ui.html
